        'WORD FIRST: truth is settled (Psalms 119:89), personal (John 14:6), and defined by Jesus as the Word (John 17:17) - before any medium existed.',
        'The essay\'s five media ages, each answered: oral social amnesia (Gonja\'s 7-to-5 sons) vs the burned roll rewritten (Jeremiah 36); writing\'s abstraction vs Sinai\'s stone and the king\'s own copy (Exodus 31:18; Deuteronomy 17:18); the Gutenberg Parenthesis - which opened on the printed Bible; itching ears instrumented (2 Timothy 4:3-4 vs the 1937 first like button); truth-as-referendum vs Exodus 23:2 and the broad way.',
