      'You have the personal test, which is sharper than an opinion about a merger: "All things are lawful unto me, but all things are not expedient" and "I will not be brought under the power of any" (1 Corinthians 6:12).',
      'Carry it out this week: name the one platform you could not walk away from tomorrow — the vendor quietly holding your chips, your models, your data and your tools at once — and decide what it would take to be able to leave.',
