        'The Person no memory manager can be: John 14:26; 16:13; 15:26; the tomb - Luke 24:6, 8; John 2:22; the right word in the same hour (Luke 12:12; Matthew 10:19-20); written on the heart (Jeremiah 31:33; 2 Corinthians 3:3; Proverbs 3:3; 7:3; Psalms 119:11, 16; 77:11; Lamentations 3:21); and His chosen forgetting - Isaiah 43:25; Hebrews 8:12; 10:17 - mercy, not architecture.',
