  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Week 23 - captured 2026-09-18 by the Gmail-lesson-intake Way (DR-0312):
  // Darrell forwarded (from dpoe@illinois.edu, his Lesson. marker) The Neuron
  // issue FW: AI Agents Just Out-Mathed Us (September 18, 2026), whose lead is
  // an interview of an OpenAI researcher by a podcaster. So the passage leads
  // and the report is only the occasion. The plumbline is held from OUTSIDE the
  // wall (Amos 7:7-8; Proverbs 28:26); cooperation trained without a standard
  // becomes collusion - agreeing together instead of reproving (Acts 5:9 against
  // Leviticus 19:17; Ephesians 5:11; Exodus 23:2), answered by a man who
  // withstood to the face (Galatians 2:11-14); obscured reasoning meets the One
  // from whom nothing is hid (John 3:19-20; Luke 12:2-3; Hebrews 4:13); zero
