        '"In the mouth of two or three witnesses shall every word be established." (2 Corinthians 13:1). Name the decision you are carrying right now, then name your SECOND and INDEPENDENT witness for it - not the same source asked twice, and not your own confidence. If you do not have one, who could be it?',
