        '"In that he saith, A new covenant, he hath made the first old." (Hebrews 8:13) beside "The grass withereth, the flower fadeth: but the word of our God shall stand for ever." (Isaiah 40:8). Say that distinction back in your own words. Where have you heard someone use the fact that Yahweh changed the covenant as a reason to change what His Word SAYS?',
