        'THE SECOND TOUCH: "And he looked up, and said, I see men as trees, walking." (Mark 8:24) "After that he put his hands again upon his eyes, and made him look up: and he was restored, and saw every man clearly." (Mark 8:25) Check with the one it is for; a partial answer sends the hand back. The text does not say why; do not guess.',
